      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: شیردهی توصیه نمی‌شود یا باید بین دارو و شیردهی یکی انتخاب شود.",
        "en": "Label: breastfeeding not recommended, or choose between the drug and breastfeeding."
      },
      "quote": "Because of the potential for serious adverse reactions from ofloxacin in nursing infants, a decision should be made whether to discontinue nursing or to discontinue the drug, taking into account the importance of the drug to the mother.",
